       Mount ZFS filesystem on a path described by its mmoouunnttppooiinntt property, if
       the path exists and is empty.  If mmoouunnttppooiinntt is set to _l_e_g_a_c_y, the
       filesystem should be instead mounted using mount(8).

       --OO  Perform an overlay mount.  Allows mounting in non-empty mmoouunnttppooiinntt.
           See mount(8) for more information.

       --aa  Mount all available ZFS file systems.  Invoked automatically as
